 JavaScript only \"stuff\" out of the Deno Namespace (#9795)\n☐ Enable `Deno` namespace by default in workers (#8174)\n☐ Don't type check be default (#11340)\n☐ New subprocess API (#11016, #5501, #11618)\n☐ JSON Modules (#7623)\n☐ Turn TypeScript `useUnknownInCatchVariables` on (#11826)\n☐ Remove deprecated `Deno.customInspect` (#10929)\n☐ Lockfile generated by default (#11971)\n☐ op metrics refactoring/cleanup (#12109)\n☐ Switch JSX/TSX default constructors (#11186)\n☐ Remove `Deno.read()` and `Deno.write()` (#12107)\n☐ Have a single configuration for TypeScript (#12111)\n☐ Internal Origin for Persistance (#11882)\n☐ Don't report check diagnostics for _external_ scripts by default (#11970)\n☐ Use `--allow-import` for dynamic imports and workers (#8266)\n☐ `NotCapable` error to distinguish between permissions and capabilities (#7394)","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true},{"title":"Milestone","value":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/milestone/26|2.0.0\u003e","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631837587}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iOG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78433f41-12a0-47a4-a321-abcd9469e757","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"deno1.14の解説記事読んでコメント付きjsonに `.jsonc` という拡張子があるのを初めて知った","ts":"1632016948.320500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C+jE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"094e7b40-a580-480f-bcc3-e11554756000","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"まあファイル作るのはユーザーなので大丈夫そう","ts":"1632016451.319800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BS0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcb68844-9c90-4006-bdf0-9808fbddc81c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"雑にt